**Q9. If we deploy before MPS is ready to read `taxLines`, will the import ignore the new field without rejecting the item?** (MPS / Common Services)
- **Context:** the two systems release separately.
- **Suggested:** MPS ignores unknown fields, so either side can deploy first.
- **Impact:** decides whether our release has to wait for theirs.
